      "writtenOn": "2019-03-02T04:13:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is this safe? \"matches\" is essentially allocated on line 915. Line 1018 then gets one element of that calloc()ed memory. Then line 1019 immediately deallocates the entire calloc()ed memory, including matches[0] (aka \"result\"). We then attempt to return memory which has been deallocated.\n\nUse after free?",
      "revId": "20f5722bff56270af3d86fc49a9f246932d762a7",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
